			],
			"Message": "style(Sky): Normalize string quotes in bridge metadata\n\nReplace escaped double quotes with single quotes for the `scriptSrc` fallback value in the `_InstallSkyBridgeOnce` function within `Bridge.ts`. This aligns the string literal syntax with the surrounding codebase style and removes unnecessary escape sequences while preserving the logic.\n\nThe change affects both the initial render metadata object and the subsequent `set-html` invocation metadata object.",
			"SHA": "ec9fb30a7e1886b367c5aa8b3b9f68ecc33b3395"
		},
